{"id":"vol8-02","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-02/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":444.75,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.18,"text":"Part 3. You will hear two students of performance arts called Charlie and Gina preparing to give","words":[["Part",0.0,0.44],["3.",0.44,0.82],["You",1.7,2.32],["will",2.32,2.5],["hear",2.5,2.8],["two",2.8,3.18],["students",3.18,3.7],["of",3.7,4.0],["performance",4.0,4.36],["arts",4.36,4.98],["called",4.98,5.38],["Charlie",5.38,5.86],["and",5.86,6.3],["Gina",6.3,6.62],["preparing",6.62,7.64],["to",7.64,8.0],["give",8.0,8.18]]},{"start":8.18,"end":14.26,"text":"feedback at the end of the second year of their three year course. First you have some","words":[["feedback",8.18,8.72],["at",8.72,9.04],["the",9.04,9.14],["end",9.14,9.4],["of",9.4,9.56],["the",9.56,9.68],["second",9.68,10.0],["year",10.0,10.44],["of",10.44,10.6],["their",10.6,10.76],["three",10.76,11.1],["year",11.1,11.34],["course.",11.34,11.86],["First",13.06,13.74],["you",13.74,13.94],["have",13.94,14.08],["some",14.08,14.26]]},{"start":14.26,"end":66.57,"text":"time to look at questions 21 to 26. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["time",14.26,14.62],["to",14.62,14.88],["look",14.88,15.0],["at",15.0,15.12],["questions",15.12,15.44],["21",15.44,16.2],["to",16.2,16.46],["26.",16.46,16.96],["Now",62.61,62.95],["listen",62.95,63.29],["carefully",63.29,63.73],["and",63.73,64.11],["answer",64.11,64.51],["questions",64.51,64.89],["21",64.89,65.69],["to",65.69,65.99],["26.",65.99,66.57]]},{"start":70.23,"end":75.03,"text":"So Gina, we've got to give our tutor some feedback on how we feel about the course.","words":[["So",70.23,70.57],["Gina,",70.57,70.95],["we've",71.35,71.57],["got",71.57,71.67],["to",71.67,71.85],["give",71.85,71.95],["our",71.95,72.13],["tutor",72.13,72.35],["some",72.35,72.63],["feedback",72.63,73.13],["on",73.13,73.65],["how",73.65,73.87],["we",73.87,74.03],["feel",74.03,74.29],["about",74.29,74.49],["the",74.49,74.67],["course.",74.67,75.03]]},{"start":75.03,"end":79.59,"text":"now we've come to the end of our second year. Is it okay with you if we have a","words":[["now",75.03,75.41],["we've",75.41,75.63],["come",75.63,75.81],["to",75.81,75.97],["the",75.97,76.09],["end",76.09,76.25],["of",76.25,76.39],["our",76.39,76.53],["second",76.53,76.79],["year.",76.79,77.13],["Is",77.93,78.15],["it",78.15,78.25],["okay",78.25,78.51],["with",78.51,78.79],["you",78.79,78.99],["if",78.99,79.23],["we",79.23,79.35],["have",79.35,79.49],["a",79.49,79.59]]},{"start":79.59,"end":84.69,"text":"chat together before we go and see him? Sure Charlie. So did you choose this","words":[["chat",79.59,79.77],["together",79.77,80.17],["before",80.17,80.45],["we",80.45,80.67],["go",80.67,80.85],["and",80.85,80.97],["see",80.97,81.17],["him?",81.17,81.43],["Sure",81.73,82.07],["Charlie.",82.07,82.43],["So",83.13,83.65],["did",83.65,83.93],["you",83.93,84.11],["choose",84.11,84.45],["this",84.45,84.69]]},{"start":84.69,"end":89.61,"text":"university to do performance arts because it's got such a good reputation? That's","words":[["university",84.69,85.33],["to",85.33,85.67],["do",85.67,85.81],["performance",85.81,86.19],["arts",86.19,86.57],["because",86.57,86.91],["it's",86.91,87.15],["got",87.15,87.29],["such",87.29,87.55],["a",87.55,87.71],["good",87.71,87.87],["reputation?",87.87,88.47],["That's",89.09,89.61]]},{"start":89.61,"end":95.69,"text":"what hooked me in. Well there are other good places which I also considered but","words":[["what",89.61,89.73],["hooked",89.73,89.93],["me",89.93,90.11],["in.",90.11,90.33],["Well",90.73,91.17],["there",91.17,91.83],["are",91.83,92.09],["other",92.09,92.49],["good",92.49,92.73],["places",92.73,93.25],["which",93.25,93.63],["I",93.63,93.85],["also",93.85,94.27],["considered",94.27,94.95],["but",94.95,95.69]]},{"start":95.69,"end":100.23,"text":"when I looked into things further I was impressed by the connections this course","words":[["when",95.69,95.83],["I",95.83,96.01],["looked",96.01,96.21],["into",96.21,96.53],["things",96.53,96.93],["further",96.93,97.29],["I",97.29,97.63],["was",97.63,97.81],["impressed",97.81,98.23],["by",98.23,98.61],["the",98.61,98.83],["connections",98.83,99.41],["this",99.41,99.93],["course",99.93,100.23]]},{"start":100.23,"end":106.89,"text":"course has with a whole range of theatres of different types. So, even though I was tempted","words":[["course",100.23,100.37],["has",100.37,100.61],["with",100.61,100.89],["a",100.89,100.99],["whole",100.99,101.27],["range",101.27,101.73],["of",101.73,101.97],["theatres",101.97,102.65],["of",102.65,102.81],["different",102.81,103.09],["types.",103.09,103.59],["So,",104.35,104.73],["even",105.21,105.73],["though",105.73,106.07],["I",106.07,106.35],["was",106.35,106.55],["tempted",106.55,106.89]]},{"start":106.89,"end":110.71,"text":"to go and study abroad, I decided to come here in the end.","words":[["to",106.89,107.23],["go",107.23,107.35],["and",107.35,107.47],["study",107.47,107.71],["abroad,",107.71,108.19],["I",108.73,108.87],["decided",108.87,109.15],["to",109.15,109.53],["come",109.53,109.75],["here",109.75,110.07],["in",110.07,110.27],["the",110.27,110.39],["end.",110.39,110.71]]},{"start":111.19,"end":112.69,"text":"And you don't regret it?","words":[["And",111.19,111.55],["you",111.55,111.83],["don't",111.83,112.01],["regret",112.01,112.37],["it?",112.37,112.69]]},{"start":112.89,"end":120.19,"text":"No! It's been brilliant! Especially the options this year. The body and dance option","words":[["No!",112.89,113.27],["It's",113.87,114.13],["been",114.13,114.29],["brilliant!",114.29,114.61],["Especially",115.29,115.93],["the",115.93,116.21],["options",116.21,116.65],["this",116.65,117.09],["year.",117.09,117.45],["The",118.47,118.65],["body",118.65,118.99],["and",118.99,119.25],["dance",119.25,119.69],["option",119.69,120.19]]},{"start":120.19,"end":123.67,"text":"I did for this term has been particularly stimulating.","words":[["I",120.19,120.53],["did",120.53,120.75],["for",120.75,120.99],["this",120.99,121.19],["term",121.19,121.51],["has",121.51,121.69],["been",121.69,121.91],["particularly",121.91,122.81],["stimulating.",122.81,123.67]]},{"start":123.67,"end":130.25,"text":"Hmm, I'm sorry I didn't go for that one too. But I did dance and drama, which was brilliant too.","words":[["Hmm,",123.67,124.49],["I'm",124.89,125.05],["sorry",125.05,125.35],["I",125.35,125.55],["didn't",125.55,125.77],["go",125.77,125.91],["for",125.91,126.05],["that",126.05,126.19],["one",126.19,126.35],["too.",126.35,126.65],["But",127.35,127.57],["I",127.57,127.75],["did",127.75,127.97],["dance",127.97,128.29],["and",128.29,128.59],["drama,",128.59,128.99],["which",129.19,129.39],["was",129.39,129.53],["brilliant",129.53,129.83],["too.",129.83,130.25]]},{"start":131.05,"end":136.41,"text":"I think the most valuable option I've done was the movement analysis course we did in the first year.","words":[["I",131.05,131.25],["think",131.25,131.39],["the",131.39,131.53],["most",131.53,131.69],["valuable",131.69,132.17],["option",132.17,132.65],["I've",132.65,133.01],["done",133.01,133.25],["was",133.25,133.53],["the",133.53,133.71],["movement",133.71,134.13],["analysis",134.13,134.83],["course",134.83,135.23],["we",135.23,135.49],["did",135.49,135.65],["in",135.65,135.77],["the",135.77,135.91],["first",135.91,136.11],["year.",136.11,136.41]]},{"start":136.79,"end":142.79,"text":"Absolutely. It's provided a great foundation for all our other work since then.","words":[["Absolutely.",136.79,137.39],["It's",138.55,138.89],["provided",138.89,139.37],["a",139.37,139.67],["great",139.67,139.89],["foundation",139.89,140.67],["for",140.67,141.11],["all",141.11,141.33],["our",141.33,141.51],["other",141.51,141.77],["work",141.77,142.05],["since",142.05,142.35],["then.",142.35,142.79]]},{"start":143.47,"end":150.43,"text":"So let's talk about our work experience last summer. You went to Finland, didn't you?","words":[["So",143.47,143.93],["le