,["questions",216.91,217.33],["we",217.33,217.65],["have",217.65,217.85],["too,",217.85,218.11],["of",218.21,218.31],["course.",218.31,218.57]]},{"start":219.53,"end":226.47,"text":"I also think it could be helpful to discuss our future plans. For example, what we're","words":[["I",219.53,219.81],["also",219.81,220.19],["think",220.19,220.47],["it",220.47,220.67],["could",220.67,220.87],["be",220.87,221.09],["helpful",221.09,221.53],["to",221.53,221.79],["discuss",221.79,222.19],["our",222.19,222.69],["future",222.69,223.07],["plans.",223.07,223.75],["For",224.63,224.77],["example,",224.77,225.19],["what",225.89,226.17],["we're",226.17,226.47]]},{"start":226.47,"end":233.57,"text":"planning to do our dissertations on. Sure. I was unsure about whether to focus on globalization","words":[["planning",226.47,226.79],["to",226.79,227.11],["do",227.11,227.35],["our",227.35,227.57],["dissertations",227.57,228.65],["on.",228.65,229.07],["Sure.",229.61,230.11],["I",230.59,231.01],["was",231.01,231.15],["unsure",231.15,231.53],["about",231.53,231.83],["whether",231.83,232.11],["to",232.11,232.29],["focus",232.29,232.61],["on",232.61,232.91],["globalization",232.91,233.57]]},{"start":233.57,"end":239.73,"text":"in dance or on stage design. I did an essay on globalization in my first year","words":[["in",233.57,234.11],["dance",234.11,234.41],["or",234.41,234.77],["on",234.77,234.99],["stage",234.99,235.41],["design.",235.41,235.93],["I",236.59,237.03],["did",237.03,237.21],["an",237.21,237.35],["essay",237.35,237.63],["on",237.63,237.85],["globalization",237.85,238.35],["in",238.35,238.95],["my",238.95,239.13],["first",239.13,239.47],["year",239.47,239.73]]},{"start":239.73,"end":244.87,"text":"and really enjoyed it. But then I saw a spectacular production at the Royal","words":[["and",239.73,240.01],["really",240.01,240.41],["enjoyed",240.41,240.85],["it.",240.85,241.15],["But",241.67,241.95],["then",241.95,242.23],["I",242.23,242.51],["saw",242.51,242.69],["a",242.69,242.81],["spectacular",242.81,243.37],["production",243.37,243.95],["at",243.95,244.43],["the",244.43,244.55],["Royal",244.55,244.87]]},{"start":244.87,"end":250.17,"text":"Opera House and that settled me on stage design. I know another student who's","words":[["Opera",244.87,245.15],["House",245.15,245.49],["and",245.49,246.17],["that",246.17,246.35],["settled",246.35,246.71],["me",246.71,246.95],["on",246.95,247.17],["stage",247.17,247.51],["design.",247.51,247.95],["I",248.65,249.03],["know",249.03,249.19],["another",249.19,249.49],["student",249.49,249.87],["who's",249.87,250.17]]},{"start":250.17,"end":254.09,"text":"planning to work on that too, so we can discuss things together a bit.","words":[["planning",250.17,250.43],["to",250.43,250.69],["work",250.69,250.87],["on",250.87,251.05],["that",251.05,251.23],["too,",251.23,251.57],["so",251.93,252.49],["we",252.49,252.61],["can",252.61,252.71],["discuss",252.71,253.05],["things",253.05,253.39],["together",253.39,253.73],["a",253.73,253.95],["bit.",253.95,254.09]]},{"start":254.41,"end":260.13,"text":"Okay, that could be useful. I'm planning to do something on current trends in","words":[["Okay,",254.41,254.81],["that",255.25,255.55],["could",255.55,255.75],["be",255.75,255.93],["useful.",255.93,256.29],["I'm",257.13,257.59],["planning",257.59,257.89],["to",257.89,258.13],["do",258.13,258.35],["something",258.35,258.71],["on",258.71,258.95],["current",258.95,259.41],["trends",259.41,259.91],["in",259.91,260.13]]},{"start":260.13,"end":266.15,"text":"contemporary dance, for my dissertation. That sounds pretty challenging. It's a big topic.","words":[["contemporary",260.13,260.73],["dance,",260.73,261.25],["for",261.67,261.79],["my",261.79,261.95],["dissertation.",261.95,262.39],["That",263.07,263.31],["sounds",263.31,263.71],["pretty",263.71,264.07],["challenging.",264.07,264.63],["It's",265.19,265.41],["a",265.41,265.53],["big",265.53,265.75],["topic.",265.75,266.15]]},{"start":267.15,"end":274.01,"text":"It might not be easy to organise in a coherent way. I've thought about it quite a lot, and","words":[["It",267.15,267.49],["might",267.49,267.65],["not",267.65,267.85],["be",267.85,268.05],["easy",268.05,268.41],["to",268.41,268.61],["organise",268.61,269.05],["in",269.05,269.39],["a",269.39,269.51],["coherent",269.51,269.93],["way.",269.93,270.39],["I've",271.15,271.77],["thought",271.77,272.05],["about",272.05,272.43],["it",272.43,272.69],["quite",272.69,272.93],["a",272.93,273.19],["lot,",273.19,273.51],["and",273.69,274.01]]},{"start":274.01,"end":279.89,"text":"I think that'll be OK, and I feel confident about how to write a longer piece of work.","words":[["I",274.01,274.17],["think",274.17,274.35],["that'll",274.35,274.65],["be",274.65,274.79],["OK,",274.79,275.13],["and",275.85,276.07],["I",276.07,276.19],["feel",276.19,276.37],["confident",276.37,276.91],["about",276.91,277.47],["how",277.47,277.85],["to",277.85,278.05],["write",278.05,278.35],["a",278.35,278.61],["longer",278.61,278.91],["piece",278.91,279.33],["of",279.33,279.53],["work.",279.53,279.89]]},{"start":280.63,"end":289.11,"text":"I'm in a bit of a panic, though, about how I'll get through all the literature. There","words":[["I'm",280.63,281.03],["in",281.03,281.29],["a",281.29,281.45],["bit",281.45,281.65],["of",281.65,281.83],["a",281.83,281.93],["panic,",281.93,282.39],["though,",282.65,282.83],["about",283.27,283.53],["how",283.53,283.95],["I'll",283.95,284.29],["get",284.29,284.47],["through",284.47,284.93],["all",284.93,285.33],["the",285.33,285.49],["literature.",285.49,286.05],["There",288.47,289.11]]},{"start":289.11,"end":291.19,"text":"Hopefully, it won't all be relevant.","words":[["Hopefully,",289.11,289.39],["it",289.63,289.75],["won't",289.75,290.05],["all",290.05,290.39],["be",290.39,290.67],["relevant.",290.67,291.19]]},{"start":291.75,"end":292.13,"text":"Quite.","words":[["Quite.",291.75,292.13]]},{"start":295.79,"end":301.59,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at Questions 27-30.","words":[["Before",295.79,296.11],["you",296.11,296.39],["hear",296.39,296.65],["the",296.65,296.83],["rest",296.83,297.09],["of",297.09,297.23],["the",297.23,297.29],["discussion,",297.29,297.71],["you",298.33,298.51],["have",298.51,298.69],["some",298.69,298.89],["time",298.89,299.31],["to",299.31,299.59],["look",299.59,299.69],["at",299.69,299.83],["Questions",299.83,300.17],["27",300.17,300.97],["-30.",300.97,301.59]]},{"start":321.91,"end":325.37,"text":"Now listen and answer Questions 27-30.","words":[["Now",321.91,322.25],["listen",322.25,322.55],["and",322.55,322.97],["answer",322.97,323.33],["Questions",323.33,323.79],["27",323.79,324.71],["-30.",324.71,325.37]]},{"start":328.85,"end":331.25,"text":"So have you made any career plans yet?","words":[["So",328.85,329.29],["have",329.29,329.59],["you",329.59,329.73],["made",329.73,329.95],["any",329.95,330.13],["career",330.13,330.51],["plans",330.51,330.91],["yet?",330.91,331.25]]},{"start":331.91,"end":333.65,"text":"I'm still undecided.","words":[["I'm",331.91,332.23],["still",332.23,332.71],["undecided.",332.71,333.65]]},{"start":334.33,"end":336.61,"text":"I've thought about performance, of course.","words":[["I've",334.33,334.65],["thought",334.65,334.83],["about",334.83,335.13],["performance,",335.13,335.87],["of",336.19,336.31],["course.",336.31,336.61]]},{"start":337.13,"end":337.45,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",337.13,337.45]]},{"start":337.83,"end":342.57,"text":"I think lots of graduates from here take that route, but it's a hard life involving","words":[["I",337.83,337.99],["think",337.99,338.15],["lots",338.15,338.35],["of",338.35,338.59],["graduates",338.59,338.97],["from",338.97,339.25],["here",339.25,339.59],["take",339.59,339.97],["that",339.97,340.21],["route,",340.21,340.45],["but",340.99,341.17],["it's",341.17,341.31],["a",341.31,341.41],["hard",341.41,341.67],["life",341.67,342.03],["involving",342.03,342.57]]},{"start":342.57,"end":347.13,"text":"involving lots of tough, repetitive practice as well as actually appearing on stage.","words":[["involving",342.57,342.79],["lots",342.79,343.01],["of",343.01,343.19],["tough,",343.19,343.51],["repetitive",343.73,344.09],["practice",344.09,344.69],["as",344.69,345.33],["well",345.33,345.51],["as",345.51,345.63],["actually",345.63,346.05],["appearing",346.05,346.49],["on",346.49,346.73],["stage.",346.73,347.13]]},{"start":347.55,"end":353.37,"text":"Yes, but the performance I've met know that's essential for the job and say they wouldn't","words":[["Yes,",347.55,347.81],["but",348.17,348.33],["the",348.33,348.47],["performance",348.47,348.83],["I've",348.83,349.27],["met",349.27,349.53],["know",349.53,349.97],["that's",349.97,350.49],["essential",350.49,351.01],["for",351.01,351.29],["the",351.29,351.37],["job",351.37,351.73],["and",351.73,352.29],["say",352.29,352.59],["they",352.59,352.91],["wouldn't",352.91,353.37]]},{"start":353.37,"end":355.39,"text":"change what they do for the world.","words":[["change",353.37,353.75],["what",353.75,354.07],["they",354.07,354.25],["do",354.25,354.55],["for",354.55,354.79],["the",354.79,354.91],["world.",354.91,355.39]]},{"start":355.99,"end":360.99,"text":"I know lots of graduates go into education, teaching at various levels, but that means","words":[["I",355.99,356.17],["know",356.17,356.29],["lots",356.29,356.55],["of",356.55,356.69],["graduates",356.69,357.11],["go",357.11,357.43],["into",357.43,357.65],["education,",357.65,358.27],["teaching",358.57,358.93],["at",358.93,359.15],["various",359.15,359.47],["levels,",359.47,359.95],["but",360.35,360.59],["that",360.59,360.75],["means",360.75,360.99]]},{"start":360.99,"end":366.53,"text":"doing some kind of post-grad certificate. But I think it would be interesting, rewarding","words":[["doing",360.99,361.25],["some",361.25,361.55],["kind",361.55,361.81],["of",361.81,362.09],["post",362.09,362.41],["-grad",362.41,362.69],["certificate.",362.69,363.17],["But",363.69,364.23],["I",364.23,364.57],["think",364.57,364.77],["it",364.77,364.95],["would",364.95,365.09],["be",365.09,365.31],["interesting,",365.31,365.87],["rewarding",366.11,366.53]]},{"start":366.53,"end":366.89,"text":"work.","words":[["work.",366.53,366.89]]},{"start":367.41,"end":371.43,"text":"I was wondering about theatre management as a possible option.","words":[["I",367.41,367.85],["was",367.85,368.11],["wondering",368.11,368.49],["about",368.49,368.87],["theatre",368.87,369.31],["management",369.31,370.01],["as",370.01,370.45],["a",370.45,370.57],["possible",370.57,370.91],["option.",370.91,371.43]]},{"start":371.43,"end":375.03,"text":"That's what our tutor did before he got into teaching, isn't it?","words":[["That's",371.43,372.37],["what",372.37,372.49],["our",372.49,372.69],["tutor",372.69,372.99],["did",372.99,373.37],["before",373.37,373.69],["he",373.69,373.87],["got",373.87,373.99],["into",373.99,374.23],["teaching,",374.23,374.57],["isn't",374.71,374.87],["it?",374.87,375.03]]},{"start":375.31,"end":378.73,"text":"Yes, but he said he quickly realised it wasn't for him.","words":[["Yes,",375.31,375.61],["but",375.77,375.93],["he",375.93,376.07],["said",376.07,376.29],["he",376.29,376.47],["quickly",376.47,376.83],["realised",376.83,377.37],["it",377.37,377.83],["wasn't",377.83,378.25],["for",378.25,378.47],["him.",378.47,378.73]]},{"start":379.37,"end":381.27,"text":"He wasn't earning enough to live on.","words":[["He",379.37,379.55],["wasn't",379.55,379.87],["earning",379.87,380.25],["enough",380.25,380.61],["to",380.61,380.77],["live",380.77,380.97],["on.",380.97,381.27]]},{"start":382.01,"end":386.69,"text":"I can imagine his communication skills are better than his business skills as well.","words":[["I",382.01,382.19],["can",382.19,382.33],["imagine",382.33,382.71],["his",382.71,382.99],["communication",382.99,383.67],["skills",383.67,384.43],["are",384.43,384.65],["better",384.65,384.99],["than",384.99,385.19],["his",385.19,385.39],["business",385.39,385.75],["skills",385.75,386.23],["as",386.23,386.41],["well.",386.41,386.69]]},{"start":387.65,"end":389.33,"text":"Marketing's a possibility, of course.","words":[["Marketing's",387.65,388.25],["a",388.25,388.29],["possibility,",388.29,388.79],["of",389.03,389.09],["course.",389.09,389.33]]},{"start":390.09,"end":394.43,"text":"Sure. I've read something saying it can be an interesting career,","words":[["Sure.",390.09,390.51],["I've",391.17,391.57],["read",391.57,391.77],["something",391.77,392.25],["saying",392.25,392.71],["it",392.71,392.85],["can",392.85,393.01],["be",393.01,393.19],["an",393.19,393.29],["interesting",393.29,393.79],["career,",393.79,394.43]]},{"start":394.43,"end":397.77,"text":"though I don't think many graduates go for this.","words":[["though",394.43,394.89],["I",394.89,395.21],["don't",395.21,395.47],["think",395.47,395.71],["many",395.71,396.13],["graduates",396.13,396.87],["go",396.87,397.23],["for",397.23,397.43],["this.",397.43,397.77]]},{"start":397.77,"end":404.19,"text":"But that might mean there's not so much competition as in many other fields of dance.","words":[["But",397.77,398.73],["that",398.73,399.29],["might",399.29,399.67],["mean",399.67,400.11],["there's",400.11,400.47],["not",400.47,400.67],["so",400.67,400.89],["much",400.89,401.09],["competition",401.09,401.75],["as",401.75,402.55],["in",402.55,402.69],["many",402.69,402.95],["other",402.95,403.19],["fields",403.19,403.59],["of",403.59,403.81],["dance.",403.81,404.19]]},{"start":404.61,"end":407.45,"text":"Right. So now shall we make a list?","words":[["Right.",404.61,404.93],["So",405.73,406.03],["now",406.03,406.53],["shall",406.53,406.79],["we",406.79,406.95],["make",406.95,407.13],["a",407.13,407.27],["list?",407.27,407.45]]},{"start":410.59,"end":417.25,"text":"That is the end of part 3. You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to part 3.","words":[["That",410.59,411.05],["is",411.05,411.17],["the",411.17,411.35],["end",411.35,411.73],["of",411.73,411.89],["part",411.89,412.11],["3.",412.11,412.55],["You",413.55,413.73],["now",413.73,414.01],["have",414.01,414.35],["30",414.35,414.73],["seconds",414.73,415.19],["to",415.19,415.53],["check",415.53,415.81],["your",415.81,416.01],["answers",416.01,416.39],["to",416.39,416.65],["part",416.65,416.87],["3.",416.87,417.25]]}]}